to-be-incorporated-into-paper-93 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-93 = unlines (cons "In the Hyperactive Workflow, the organization of the work on hyperactivity by a graph of tasks: **Order.**" (cons "- There is no scalar priority, value, score or estimate. A node's value is what it serves, up to the" (cons (quoted (cons "  root, " (cons "Avik wants this" (cons "." nil)))) (cons "- Dependencies give every valid order. Enabling is conjunctive: work starts only when all its" (cons "  prerequisites are resolved." (cons "- Among work that can start, X supersedes Y when the waiting work X is a prerequisite of strictly" (cons "  contains Y's. Where neither contains the other, the graph expresses no preference." (cons "- A session states what the order forces. It does not choose a schedule of its own." nil))))))))
